flowchart LR
    DEF["fa:fa-balance-scale Definition &amp; measurement<br>NEP vs actual costs; baselines; indexation"] --> BARG["fa:fa-handshake Intergovernmental bargaining (repeated)<br>Commonwealth ↔ States<br>% share, caps, indexation"]
