    POL["fa:fa-bullhorn Political blame/credit signalling<br>Voters, media, central agencies"] --> BARG
    VFI["fa:fa-exchange-alt VFI externality / cost-shifting<br>Upstream levers vs downstream hospital risk"] --> OUT["fa:fa-hospital-user Operational pressure &amp; visible failure<br>Exit block → ED overcrowding → ramping<br>Clinical risk &amp; staff harm"]
    DISC["fa:fa-procedures Discharge/placement<br>Aged Care &amp; NDIS constraints → delayed discharge"] --> OUT
    ABF["fa:fa-database Provider ABF/coding<br>Classification, coding accuracy, gaming risk"] --> DEF
    COMP["fa:fa-shield-alt Compliance &amp; integrity<br>Maintenance-of-effort; audits; allocation"] --> DEF
    GOV["fa:fa-project-diagram Governance integration<br>Parallel models (e.g., UCCs) vs LHN governance"] --> VFI
    OUT -. Escalates political pressure .-> POL
    OUT -. Triggers new bargaining round .-> BARG
    BARG --> DEF & COMP & GOV & SOFT

